                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Subtract the two nonmeeting triangles from the sample-space square, then divide by the square's area.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "The nonmeeting regions are two right triangles. Their perpendicular sides are $120-45=75$ and $120-30=90$ minutes respectively.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}A_{\\text{not meet}}&=\\frac12(75)^2+\\frac12(90)^2\\\\A_{\\text{not meet}}&=\\frac{13725}{2}\\\\P(\\text{meet})&=1-\\frac{13725/2}{120^2}\\\\P(\\text{meet})&=\\frac{67}{128}.\\end{align*}$$\n\nIndependent uniform arrival times make probability proportional to area.",
          "solutionDiagrams": [
            {
              "id": "p15-q49-c-solution-region",
              "role": "solution",
              "format": "tikz",
              "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"meetingFill\",\"hex\":\"E8DEF4\",\"reason\":\"Identifies the favourable meeting region whose area determines the probability\"}],\"reference\":\"PDF15 printed510 question49(c) authored solution region\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.05cm,y=0.05cm]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\definecolor{meetingFill}{HTML}{E8DEF4}\n\\fill[meetingFill] (0,0)--(30,0)--(120,90)--(120,120)--(75,120)--(0,45)--cycle;\n\\draw[black,line width=0.8pt] (0,0) rectangle (120,120);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.8pt] (0,45)--(75,120);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.8pt] (30,0)--(120,90);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.5pt,->] (-15,0)--(142,0) node[right] {$x$};\n\\draw[black,line width=0.5pt,->] (0,-15)--(0,142) node[above] {$y$};\n\\node[black] at (60,60) {Meet};\n\\node[black,below] at (30,0) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$30$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};\n\\node[black,below] at (120,0) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$120$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};\n\\node[black,left] at (0,45) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$45$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};\n\\node[black,left] at (0,120) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$120$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};\n\\node[black,above] at (75,120) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$75$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};\n\\node[black,right] at (120,90) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$90$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
